    "journalReadings": {
      "note": "Every non-zero AmmoInClip / AmmoInHopper across the three journal captures — the only external readings of `clipSize` and `ammoMaximum` this repository holds. Eight of the nine sit exactly at capacity, on seven distinct modules across all three captures. The ninth is the Viper's heat-sink launcher, reporting 2 in reserve against a capacity of 3: what a launcher that has fired one heat sink looks like. That is the whole reason a journal's ammunition is a rearm state and not a capacity — a reading is a lower bound on what the module holds, and only a bound, so no reading may be read back as a catalogue figure.",
